852	    /**
853	     * Normalizes a value for case-insensitive, whitespace-collapsed household comparison: leading and
854	     * trailing whitespace is trimmed, any internal run of whitespace is collapsed to a single space,
855	     * and the result is lower-cased. A {@code null} value normalizes to an empty string.
856	     *
857	     * @param value the raw value, possibly {@code null}
