The effective URL is `POST /petclinic/api/owners` (context path `/petclinic/` from `src/main/resources/application.properties:25`, controller base `/api`, operation path `/owners`). The controller implements a generated OpenAPI interface, so the HTTP mapping and request-body `@Valid` live in the generated interface while the body logic lives in the controller.

