### In-controller validation / normalization (in execution order)

All helper methods are in the same controller file:
- `validateRequiredFields` (559-580): rejects blank firstName, lastName, address (checks both `addressLine1` and flat `address` after normalization), city, telephone → throws `InvalidOwnerFieldsException`.
- `rejectFutureRegistrationDate` (416-420): supplied date after `LocalDate.now()` → `FutureRegistrationDateException` (400).
- `Owner.resolveRegistrationDate` (defaulting + business-day roll, see entity).
- `requireDailyCapacity` (433-437): `>= MAX_OWNERS_PER_DAY` (100) owners already on that date → `DailyOwnerLimitException` (429). Counts via `countOwnersRegisteredOn` which calls `clinicService.findAllOwners()`.
- `countOwnersInCity` / `requireCityHasCapacity` (463-467): `>= MAX_OWNERS_PER_CITY` (50) in city (case-insensitive) → `CityOwnerLimitException` (409).
- `isApproachingCityCapacity` (493-495): 40–49 → sets `capacityWarning`.
- `validatePostcode` (507-520): if postcode present and city's region known, value must be within `REGION_POSTCODE_RANGES` (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099) → else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["postcode"])`.
- `applyAddress` (918-931) + `normalizeAddress` (890-904): upper-cases, collapses whitespace, expands ST→STREET, RD→ROAD, AVE→AVENUE.
- `normalizeTelephone`/`toE164`/`nationalNumberLengthValid` (591-652): converts to E.164; default country code `+61`; requires 8–15 digits; `+61` needs 9 national digits, `+1` needs 10 → else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["telephone"])`.
- `normalizeEmail` (665-679): optional; must match `EMAIL_PATTERN`; domain not in `DISPOSABLE_EMAIL_DOMAINS` (mailinator.com, tempmail.com, guerrillamail.com); lower-cased → else `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["email"])`.
- `computeHouseholdId` (836-850): SHA-256-derived 12-hex household id.
- `requireUniqueIdentity` (694-702): if any non-deleted existing owner shares `getIdentityKey()` → `DuplicateIdentityException` (409).
- `flagPossibleDuplicate` (746-762): soft-duplicate detection via last-name Soundex + postcode.
- `deduplicateMemberId` (714-729): appends `-2`, `-3`… on member-id collision.
- `countNamesakes` (531-536), `stampHouseholdSize` (772-780, also re-saves other household members), `capMembershipLevelToHousehold` (809-821).
- `bulkSignupWarning`: `countOwnersRegisteredOn(...) > 80`.
- Idempotency via `Idempotency-Key` header: `currentIdempotencyKey` (361-369), `replayIfSeen` (380-390), `rememberCreate` (400-404), backed by in-memory `idempotentCreates` map (line 198). A repeat key returns the original owner with `200 OK`.

